<title>UK: PowderJect's share placing oversubscribed-Flemings.</title>
<headline>PowderJect's share placing oversubscribed-Flemings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's PowderJect Pharmaceuticals Plc raised 35 million stg in its share placing, which was oversubscribed, Robert Fleming &amp; Co said on Friday.</p>
<p>Flemings, on behalf of PowderJect, said the placing of 18.92 million shares at 185p each had been completed, capitalising PowderJect at 109.3 million.</p>
<p>PowderJect develops needle-free injections which shoot powdered drugs into the skin at supersonic speed.</p>
<p>Dealing in the shares was expected to begin on June 17 on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
